<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#102849">
  <meta name="description" content="An educational news verification demo.">
  <title>TruthCheck AI</title>
  <link rel="manifest" href="./manifest.json">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="./style.css">
</head>
<body>
  <main class="app">
    <header class="hero">
      <div class="logo">📰 TruthCheck AI</div>
      <p class="tagline">STOP · CHECK · VERIFY</p>
      <h1>Fake News Detection</h1>
      <p>Think before you share. Check before you believe.</p>
    </header>

    <section class="panel">
      <label for="news">Paste news or a headline</label>
      <textarea id="news" maxlength="10000"
        placeholder="Paste your news story here..."></textarea>

      <p id="counter">0 / 10000 characters</p>

      <div class="actions">
        <button id="checkBtn">🔍 Check News</button>
        <button id="clearBtn" class="secondary">Clear</button>
      </div>

      <section id="result" class="result" aria-live="polite">
        <div class="result-icon">🔎</div>
        <h2>Ready to investigate?</h2>
        <p>Your result will appear here.</p>
      </section>

      <h2 class="tips-title">🛡️ Verification tips</h2>
      <ul class="tips">
        <li>Check the original source.</li>
        <li>Compare trusted news outlets.</li>
        <li>Verify dates and supporting evidence.</li>
        <li>Be careful with sensational headlines.</li>
      </ul>

      <p class="disclaimer">
        Educational demo only. Results are not proof of truth or falsehood.
        Always verify claims using reliable sources.
      </p>
    </section>

    <footer>TruthCheck AI · Verify before sharing</footer>
  </main>

  <script src="./script.js" defer></script>
</body>
</html>
